      "text": "12 August، 2022\n\nQunaitra, SANA-Two citizens were wounded in an attack with two tank missiles fired by the Israeli occupation on the neighbourhood of al-Hamidia village in Qunaitra northern countryside.\n\n“The Israeli occupation bombed Friday afternoon two tank shells on the village, injuring two people who were rushed to a hospital in the province”, SANA reporter said.\n\nA medical source at the hospital told the correspondant :“Two citizens with injuries on different parts of their bodies were admitted to the hospital. They immediately received the necessary treatment and their medical condition is stable now”.\n\nALI,Baraa\n\ntweet"
    }
